     100dvh canvas extends behind the status bar / island. The fallback
     "Henter..." text in AppProvider is the very first thing the user sees
     after the splash, and previously sat at vh/2 — directly under the
     island. Push it (and any other top-of-page content) past the cutout
     with a small base offset on top of the safe-area. */
  padding-top: calc(env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px) + 1rem);
  padding-right: env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px);
  padding-left: env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px);
}

